= Instructions

In a #Cocktail shaker{}, muddle half a @Nectarine{} until juicy.

Add all other ingredients:\
@Gin{1 1/4 oz}, @Honey syrup{1/2 oz}, @Ginger syrup{1/4 oz}, @Lemon juice{3/4 oz}, @Becherovka{1/4 oz},
and @Ice{}. Shake to chill.

Double strain into a #Coupe{}.

Garnish with a @Lemon wheel{}.